      "description": "Bordered secondary actions and explicit alternatives.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-secondary\">Decline</button>",
      "css": ".ds-secondary{font-family:var(--font-ui,Inter,sans-serif);font-size:14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:40px;padding:9px 15px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:9px;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;transition:background .18s,color .18s;background:transparent;color:var(--foreground,#212121);border-color:var(--border,#dfdfdf)}.ds-secondary:hover{background:var(--hover,#e9e9e9)}.ds-secondary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#767676);outline-offset:4px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-secondary{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Plain button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-plain",
      "description": "Quiet icon action with an accessible name.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-plain\" aria-label=\"Remove attachment\">×</button>",
      "css": ".ds-plain{font-family:var(--font-ui,Inter,sans-serif);font-size:14px;min-width:32px;min-height:32px;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:9px;background:transparent;color:var(--muted-foreground,#666);cursor:pointer;transition:background .18s,color .18s}.ds-plain:hover{background:var(--hover,#e9e9e9);color:var(--foreground,#212121)}.ds-plain:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#767676);outline-offset:4px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-plain{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "field",
      "description": "A labeled real settings or search field.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-label\">Find a task<input class=\"ds-field\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Find a task by title or goal\"></label>",
      "css": ".ds-label{font-family:var(--font-ui,Inter,sans-serif);font-size:14px;display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted-foreground,#666)}.ds-field{font-family:var(--font-ui,Inter,sans-serif);font-size:14px;display:block;width:100%;margin-top:7px;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--border,#dfdfdf);border-radius:10px;background:var(--card,#fcfcfc);color:var(--foreground,#212121)}.ds-field:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#767676);outline-offset:4px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sidebar navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation-item",
      "description": "One soft 256px navigation surface; the current link uses tone and weight.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Workspace\"><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"/\" aria-current=\"page\">Conversation</a><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"/tasks\">Tasks</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:grid;gap:4px;max-width:232px;padding:12px;background:var(--sidebar,#f3f3f3)}.ds-nav-link{font-family:var(--font-ui,Inter,sans-serif);font-size:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:42px;padding:10px 11px;border-radius:9px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted-foreground,#666)}.ds-nav-link:hover,.ds-nav-link[aria-current]{background:var(--hover,#e9e9e9);color:var(--foreground,#212121)}.ds-nav-link[aria-current]{font-weight:500}.ds-nav-link:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#767676);outline-offset:4px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Status pill",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "status-pill",
      "description": "Textual status paired with a quiet surface; this sample is informational, not an action.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-status\">Ready</span>",
      "css": ".ds-status{font-family:var(--font-ui,Inter,sans-serif);font-size:14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;border:1px solid var(--border,#dfdfdf);border-radius:20px;padding:3px 9px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--muted-foreground,#666);background:var(--background,#f9f9f9)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "panel",
      "description": "Flat bordered container used for goals, progress, decisions and settings.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><h2 class=\"ds-panel-title\">Latest progress</h2><p class=\"ds-panel-text\">Task progress appears here when available.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{font-family:var(--font-ui,Inter,sans-serif);font-size:14px;background:var(--card,#fcfcfc);color:var(--foreground,#212121);border:1px solid var(--border,#dfdfdf);border-radius:var(--radius,12px);padding:24px}.ds-panel-title{font-size:17px;font-weight:550;line-height:1.5;margin:0 0 12px}.ds-panel-text{color:var(--muted-foreground,#666);margin:0;line-height:1.6}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Composer",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "composer",
      "description": "Multiline conversation entry; this preview does not submit a message.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-composer\"><textarea class=\"ds-composer-input\" aria-label=\"Message Steward\" placeholder=\"Describe what you have in mind…\" rows=\"2\"></textarea><div class=\"ds-composer-actions\"><span class=\"ds-composer-hint\">Your ongoing conversation</span><button class=\"ds-send\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Send message\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19V5m-6 6 6-6 6 6\"/></svg></button></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-composer{max-width:768px;padding:17px 17px 12px;border:1px solid var(--border,#dfdfdf);border-radius:23px;background:var(--card,#fcfcfc);color:var(--foreground,#212121)}.ds-composer:focus-within{border-color:var(--focus,#767676)}.ds-composer-input{font-family:var(--font-ui,Inter,sans-serif);font-size:14px;display:block;width:100%;padding:0 3px 10px;min-height:62px;max-height:180px;border:0;resize:none;background:transparent;color:var(--foreground,#212121);font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;outline:none}.ds-composer-input::placeholder{color:var(--muted-foreground,#666)}.ds-composer-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}.ds-composer-hint{font-family:var(--font-ui,Inter,sans-serif);font-size:14px;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted-foreground,#666)}.ds-send{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:36px;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent,#212121);color:var(--accent-ink,#f9f9f9);cursor:pointer}.ds-send:hover{opacity:.85}.ds-send:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#767676);outline-offset:4px}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Your personal AI steward.",
    "overview": "Steward is a familiar, quiet conversation workspace: soft monochrome surfaces, readable document-style replies, restrained controls and a small plush ghost. The owner-approved `tmp/neutral-web/dist` demo defines this production presentation. This document records implemented values rather than adding a new product direction.\n\nThis is a private Web presentation system for the owner's ongoing conversation and delegated work. Server-owned HTML, bounded live-region patches and existing React UISpec islands remain the mechanism. Steward names the interface; Collie remains the compatible backend, CLI and storage identity. No public design API, domain rename or storage migration is implied. Latest refinement: four navigation entries, Task identity/progress/Worker workspace, read-only on-demand Computer desktop viewer, complete-frame ghost playback and Source Han unicode-range subsets.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "One collapsible navigation sidebar and a centered conversation.",
      "Near-white and charcoal surfaces with grayscale status treatments and restrained danger color.",
      "Inter controls, serif reply prose, a Michroma wordmark and a stable, expressive ghost.",
      "Real tasks, artifacts and frozen approvals presented with their existing semantics."
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "dos": [
      "Do use the semantic light/dark tokens and implemented font roles.",
      "Do keep one application sidebar, a centered conversation and on-demand Computer and Worker detail panes.",
      "Do preserve durable send, readiness, approval, attachment and replay contracts when changing presentation.",
      "Do keep technical detail available through its existing disclosures and Developer pages."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't fabricate multiple chats, recent items, task counts, a global memory browser or a file library.",
      "Don't imply that approval means execution completed, or resend an unknown external outcome.",
      "Don't rename Collie backend/CLI/storage contracts to implement the Steward Web brand.",
      "Don't introduce a permanent second navigation rail, decorative panel shadows or unapproved body scaling/rotation."
    ]
  }
}
